# Dead start COS 1.17 through the I/O Subsystem and run a batch job.
#
#   tools/target/release/cray-xmp-sys "$CRAY_XMP_SYSTEM" --script tests/sys/cos.script
#
# The kernel console is the operator's console of the MIOP; the station is
# the first of its other consoles.  About 70 seconds of machine time.

# the I/O Subsystem has no clock: the operator gives the date and the time
wait kernel ENTER DATE [MM/DD/YY]
run 100
type kernel 06/06/89
wait kernel ENTER TIME [HH:MM:SS]
run 100
type kernel 12:35:38
run 500

# load COS from the disk on the Peripheral Expander and dead start the mainframe
type kernel START COS_117 DEADSTART
wait kernel MFINIT: COMPLETE
wait kernel CPU <-> MIOP LINKAGE COMPLETE
wait kernel START COMPLETE
run 1000

# the operator station
type kernel STATION
wait station CRAY STATION.  VERSION 4.2.2, IOS.
type station LOGON
wait station COS 1.17  02/28/89
type station STMSG
wait station ENTER CONFIGURATION CHANGES OR 'GO' TO CONTINUE
type station REPLY,0,GO
run 10000
type station STMSG
wait station NO LABEL WAS FOUND ON DEVICE BMR-0-20
type station REPLY,10,CONTINUE
run 12000
type station STMSG,I
wait station STARTUP IS PERFORMING A DEADSTART
wait station THE $DSC-EXTENSION WAS CREATED AND SAVED SUCCESSFULLY.
screen station

# let jobs in and run one
type station CLASS,ALL,ON
run 1000
type station LIMIT,5
run 1000
type station STATUS
wait station CRAY SYSTEM STATUS
type station SUBMIT,JTEST30
run 5000
type kernel IAIOP LOG
wait printer JOB,JN=JTEST30,T=8.
wait printer PD009 - DATASET NOT FOUND
wait printer END OF JOB
screen station
